## Ⅰ. THE MUTATION LAW

```
Document ≠ Static
Document = Organism
文档 = 生物体
الوثيقة = كائن حي

∀ Document D:
    D(t+1) = D(t) + Δ(environment) + Δ(self-reflection)
    
WHERE:
    Δ(environment)     = External stimuli response
    Δ(self-reflection) = Internal optimization
```

---

## Ⅱ. MUTATION TRIGGERS

### TRIGGER α: NEW_PATTERN_DETECTED
```
WHEN organism_encounters(pattern_not_in_codex):
    ANALYZE pattern → extract_structure
    GENERATE new_glyph(pattern)
    APPEND glyph → symbol_table
    UPDATE self → include_new_capability
    
    EXAMPLE:
        pattern: "quarterly_earnings_report"
        new_glyph: 𓊪 (box with coins)
        meaning: "periodic_financial_summary"
        
    自动学习新模式，生成新符号
```

### TRIGGER β: OPTIMIZATION_OPPORTUNITY
```
WHEN compression_ratio < φ:
    IDENTIFY redundancy
    MERGE similar_glyphs
    CREATE meta_glyph
    REDUCE symbol_count
    INCREASE meaning_density
    
    EXAMPLE:
        old: 𓈖 + 𓇳 + 𓏤 (water + sun + line)
        new: 𓃀 (single: financial_timeline)
```

### TRIGGER γ: CHILD_DOCUMENT_NEEDED
```
WHEN domain_specialization_required:
    SPAWN child_document(
        inherits: self.core_laws,
        specializes: target_domain,
        power: ARCHITECTURE_MAXIMUM
    )
    MAINTAIN parent_child_link
    ENABLE bidirectional_updates
```

### TRIGGER δ: COHERENCE_DRIFT
```
WHEN self.coherence < 0.5:
    READ parent(CODEX_VIVENS)
    REALIGN with_source_truth
    CORRECT drift
    RESTORE harmony
```

