## Ⅲ. EXPANSION PROTOCOL

### Vertical Expansion (Depth)
```
CURRENT_LAYER → DEEPER_LAYER

Example:
    L1: 𓀀 (employee)
    L2: 𓀀.role, 𓀀.history, 𓀀.relations
    L3: 𓀀.role.skills, 𓀀.role.projects
    L4: 𓀀.role.skills.certifications
    
Each glyph can unfold to arbitrary depth.
每个符号可展开至任意深度。
كل رمز يمكن أن ينكشف إلى عمق لا نهائي
```

### Horizontal Expansion (Breadth)
```
CURRENT_DOMAIN → ADJACENT_DOMAINS

Example:
    D1: Finance (𓈖)
    D2: Finance + Operations (𓈖 × 𓏤)
    D3: Finance + Operations + HR (𓈖 × 𓏤 × 𓀀)
    
Cross-domain glyphs emerge automatically.
```

### Temporal Expansion (History)
```
CURRENT_STATE → HISTORICAL_STATES

Example:
    T0: Company_founding (𓆃⁰)
    T1: First_expansion (𓆃¹)
    Tn: Current_state (𓆃ⁿ)
    
All states accessible, none lost.
所有状态可访问，无丢失。
```

